<Slide
  style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column' }}
  notes={`参数绑定有五个注解，我们逐个说。

RequestParam：从表单或者 query string 取值，可以带 name 和 default 两个属性。注意 default 很有用，参数缺省时给个兜底值。

RequestParamObject：同样是表单或者 query，但会按字段名逐个取值填到一个对象里——也就是说传一个 PO 进来，不用你手动 set。

PathVariable：取路径参数，也就是 path 里大括号里定义的那些，同样可以带 name 和 default。

RequestHeader：取请求头，可以带 name 和 default。

RequestBody：取请求体，按 Content-Type 解析——JSON 请求体就解析成对象，表单就按表单处理，multipart 就解析成文件对象。

看右边这四条声明，一次看全四种写法。第一条是注册接口，两个 RequestParam 分别取 username 和 password，consumes 是表单，produces 是纯文本，同时忽略鉴权和权限。第二条是登录，用 RequestBody 把 JSON 请求体变成 UserRequest 对象。第三条是 echo，用 RequestParamObject 直接把表单字段填进 UserRequest。第四条用 RequestHeader 取 userId 和 token 两个请求头。

最下面两条是路径参数和默认值的写法：PathVariable 取 id；RequestParam 带 default 给空字符串兜底。`}
>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: 4, height: 40, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>第 10 章 · MVC f_mvc · 10.2</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>参数绑定注解</Text>
    </Box>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>一次看全四种写法</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
    <Table
      style={{ width: '100%', height: 196 }}
      defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 14, textAlign: 'left', color: '#E2E8F0' }}
      defaultCellStyle={{ border: { left: { width: 1, color: '#1E293B' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#1E293B' }, top: { width: 1, color: '#1E293B' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#1E293B' } } }}
      cells={[
        [ { text: '注解', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#22D3EE', fontSize: 13 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#16233A' } } }, { text: '来源', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#22D3EE', fontSize: 13 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#16233A' } } }, { text: '备注', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#22D3EE', fontSize: 13 }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#16233A' } } } ],
        [ { text: '@RequestParam', textStyle: { color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace' } }, '表单 / query string', '可带 name 与 default' ],
        [ { text: '@RequestParamObject', textStyle: { color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace' } }, '表单 / query → 对象', '按字段名逐个取值' ],
        [ { text: '@PathVariable', textStyle: { color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace' } }, '路径参数', '可带 name / default' ],
        [ { text: '@RequestHeader', textStyle: { color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace' } }, '请求头', '可带 name / default' ],
        [ { text: '@RequestBody', textStyle: { color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", Consolas, monospace' } }, '请求体', '按 Content-Type 解析' ],
      ]}
    />
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#0B1220', borderRadius: 12, border: '1px solid #38BDF8', padding: 16, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B', marginBottom: 6 }}>CurrentUserController.cj</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'@PostMapping[path:\'/api/user/register\', consumes:\'application/x-www-form-urlencoded\','}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'             produces:\'text/plain\', ignoreAuth: true, ignorePrivilege: true]'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#38BDF8', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'public func register(@RequestParam username: String, @RequestParam password: String): String'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'@PostMapping[path:\'/api/user/session\', consumes:\'application/json\', produces:\'application/json\']'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'public func login(@RequestBody user: UserRequest): UserResponse'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'@PostMapping[path:\'/api/user/echo\', consumes:\'application/x-www-form-urlencoded\']'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'public func echo(@RequestParamObject user: UserRequest): UserRequest'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'@DeleteMapping[path:\'/api/user/session\']'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#F59E0B', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'public func echoSession(@RequestHeader userId: Int64, @RequestHeader token: String): JsonValue'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'public func queryUser(@PathVariable id: Int64): JsonValue'}</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono", "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace' }}>{'public func echo2(@RequestParam[default: \'\'] username: String)'}</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid #1E293B' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#64748B' }}>fountain · 一站式服务器应用开发工具库</Text>
